    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to present “La Vallée” 6B New Road to the market - a beautifully presented, four-bedroom\r\ndetached family home in the heart of Kilcoole, finished to a high standard throughout and benefiting from a substantial\r\nconverted attic.\r\n\r\nThe property has been tastefully refurbished by the current owners. A striking 5.2m window and sliding glass doors flood the\r\nopen-plan kitchen and dining room with natural light and extends the living area to the rear patio in the summer months. A\r\nbeautiful luxury Swiss Kronos laminate flooring has been laid throughout the ground floor, and a new boiler was fitted in 2022.\r\nThis beautiful famly home is approached via a cobblelock driveway with parking for multiple vehicles.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises an entrance hallway with solid timber stairs and a beautifully designed mirrored wall. The living\r\nroom is centred around a stove with slate hearth and bespoke shelving which opens to the refurbished open-plan\r\nkitchen/dining room which benefits from fully fitted units and integrated appliances. A guest WC, a utility room plumbed for\r\nwasher and dryer, and useful storage complete the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four carpeted bedrooms include a main bedroom with a picture window taking in sea and rural views, along with an\r\nen-suite shower room and a family bathroom. The converted attic - newly painted, with solid timber flooring, two Velux windows\r\nand ample eaves storage - offers wonderful additional living space with a spectacular outlook over the surrounding\r\ncountryside.\r\n\r\nOutside, the south-facing rear garden is a particular highlight: a cobblelock patio and pergola set the scene for outdoor\r\nentertaining, with two steel storage sheds, exterior lighting and sockets, and open views over the fields beyond.\r\n6B New Road sits within easy reach of Kilcoole village and its shops, schools and amenities, with convenient access to the\r\nN11 and the wider North Wicklow coast."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nLaminate wood flooring, solid timber stairs, feature mirror and alarm panel. Storage room off hall, panelled wall to landing. Guest WC and cloakroom off hallway.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Stove with slate inset and hearth, bespoke shelving, recessed lighting. Off-street parking to front.\r\n\r\nKitchen & Dining Room\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Fully fitted floor and wall units with integrated appliances, extractor fan and black composite sink. Luxury vinyl tile flooring, recessed lighting, smoke alarm.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nCarpeted, picture window to rear with sea and countryside views.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\nFully tiled, WC, shower, mains power shower, chrome heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC\r\nFully tiled, wash hand basin with under-basin storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nCarpeted, floor-to-ceiling built-in wardrobes, overlooking front.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nCarpeted, window to front.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\nCarpeted, sea views to Wicklow Town.\r\n\r\nAttic Room\r\nNewly painted, solid timber flooring and stairs, 2 Velux windows, ample eaves storage. Magnificent countryside views.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nFully tiled, bath, mains power shower, wash hand basin with under-storage, wall-mounted storage with inset lighting, chrome heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nPlumbed for washer and dryer, counter and storage space.\r\n\r\nFront\r\nCobblelock driveway with parking for multiple vehicles.\r\n\r\nRear\r\nCobblelock patio with pergola, French drain, outside tap, exterior lighting and sockets. Timber and metal gate for vehicle access, two steel storage sheds with power and lighting. Timber fencing and block walls. Stunning countryside views."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Private south facing garden with cobblelock patio\r\nand pergola.\r\nConverted attic room with solid timber flooring, two\r\nVelux windows and magnificent countryside views\r\n5.2m window with sliding glass doors to the\r\nkitchen/dining room\r\nTastefully refurbished with new modern\r\nkitchen/dining area\r\nNew luxury Swiss Kronos laminate flooring\r\nthroughout the ground floor\r\nNew boiler fitted in 2022\r\nBER: B rating\r\nStove with slate inset, hearth and bespoke shelving\r\nto the living room\r\nMain bedroom with en suite, and sea and\r\ncountryside views\r\nPrivate cul de sac setting\r\nTwo steel storage sheds to rear with power and light\r\nCobblelock driveway with ample parking for multiple\r\nvehicles\r\nOwner occupied\r\nWithin walking distance of the Sea Road\r\nMetal security gates to side\r\nGuest WC, plus a utility room plumbed for washer\r\nand dryer\r\nClose to Kilcoole village, with easy access to the\r\nN11"
      },
      {
